'''Dashing Face''' (ハシル君, ''Hashiru-kun'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[The Face]] introduced in the [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]] event. He was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

